      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            3",
      "skos:definition": "Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or\nrepealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule\nconcerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect\naccording to its terms.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            3",
      "cml:asserts": [
