    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(1) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-4-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purpose of this Division:\n\n(a) if a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\nin the person’s capacity as a director, employee or agent of\nanother body corporate, the disclosure is taken to have been\nmade by the corporation to that body corporate; and\n\n(b) if a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\nin the person’s capacity as an employee or agent of another\nperson (not being a body corporate), the disclosure is taken to\nhave been made by the corporation to that other person.\nDisclosure to discloser’s own agent",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purpose of this Division:\n\n(a) if a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\nin the person’s capacity as a director, employee or agent of\nanother body corporate, the disclosure is taken to have been\nmade by the corporation to that body corporate; and\n\n(b) if a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\nin the person’s capacity as an employee or agent of another\nperson (not being a body corporate), the disclosure is taken to\nhave been made by the corporation to that other person.\nDisclosure to discloser’s own agent",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dfee03833189ca31969d4192a3c095d112a8d1dab6f51d323b64edf7989e1641",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information to competitors is private if not to other persons. Disclosure to discloser’s own agent"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-4-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(1) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purpose of this Division:\n\n(a) if a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\nin the person’s capacity as a director, employee or agent of\nanother body corporate, the disclosure is taken to have been\nmade by the corporation to that body corporate; and\n\n(b) if a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\nin the person’s capacity as an employee or agent of another\nperson (not being a body corporate), the disclosure is taken to\nhave been made by the corporation to that other person.\nDisclosure to discloser’s own agent"
    },
