    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(2) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-4-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\ncorporation to another person is to be disregarded if:\n\n(a) the disclosure is made to the person in the person’s capacity\nas an agent of the corporation; and\n\n(b) subsection (3) does not apply to the disclosure.\nDisclosure through intermediary",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\ncorporation to another person is to be disregarded if:\n\n(a) the disclosure is made to the person in the person’s capacity\nas an agent of the corporation; and\n\n(b) subsection (3) does not apply to the disclosure.\nDisclosure through intermediary",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "868ab486d1284b5719731f97a5c684e8593ddaea95d6de46f6dc42501b51878b",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information by a corporation to another person is disregarded if made in the person's capacity as an agent of the corporation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-4-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\ncorporation to another person is to be disregarded if:\n\n(a) the disclosure is made to the person in the person’s capacity\nas an agent of the corporation; and\n\n(b) subsection (3) does not apply to the disclosure.\nDisclosure through intermediary"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-2-norm",
