    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(3) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-4-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            5\n\n(a) a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\n(the intermediary); and\n\n(b) the corporation makes the disclosure to the intermediary for\nthe purpose of the intermediary disclosing (or arranging for\nthe disclosure of) the information to one or more other\npersons; and\n\n(c) the information is so disclosed to one or more of those other\npersons (the recipients);\nthen, for the purpose of this Division:\n\n(d) the disclosure of the information to the recipients is taken to\nhave been made by the corporation; and\n\n(e) the disclosure of the information to the intermediary is to be\ndisregarded (unless the intermediary is a competitor or\npotential competitor of the corporation in a market).\nAccidental disclosure",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            5\n\n(a) a corporation makes a disclosure of information to a person\n(the intermediary); and\n\n(b) the corporation makes the disclosure to the intermediary for\nthe purpose of the intermediary disclosing (or arranging for\nthe disclosure of) the information to one or more other\npersons; and\n\n(c) the information is so disclosed to one or more of those other\npersons (the recipients);\nthen, for the purpose of this Division:\n\n(d) the disclosure of the information to the recipients is taken to\nhave been made by the corporation; and\n\n(e) the disclosure of the information to the intermediary is to be\ndisregarded (unless the intermediary is a competitor or\npotential competitor of the corporation in a market).\nAccidental disclosure",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-ltl-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-diffusion-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-3-logic-argumentation-7"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a92e1c3229258df7f24cc6dddae7ac2c12160a18ac3ff02511e6921a811d7849",
      "skos:note": "The Minister must be satisfied that the prescribed process has been complied with before regulations are made. Disclosure of information to recipients is taken to have been made by the corporation."
    },
