    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(4) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-4-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\ncorporation to a person (the recipient) is to be disregarded if the\ndisclosure to the recipient is due to:\n\n(a) an accident; or\n\n(b) the default of a person other than the corporation; or\n\n(c) some other cause beyond the control of the corporation.\nNote:\nThis subsection does not apply to a disclosure of information covered\nby subsection (3).\nSection 84 not limited",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\ncorporation to a person (the recipient) is to be disregarded if the\ndisclosure to the recipient is due to:\n\n(a) an accident; or\n\n(b) the default of a person other than the corporation; or\n\n(c) some other cause beyond the control of the corporation.\nNote:\nThis subsection does not apply to a disclosure of information covered\nby subsection (3).\nSection 84 not limited",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-4-ss-4-norm"
