    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-6-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6(2) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-6-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In determining, for the purpose of this section, if a corporation has\nmade a disclosure for the purpose of substantially lessening\ncompetition in a market, the matters to which the court may have\nregard include (but are not limited to):\n\n(a) whether the disclosure was a private disclosure to\ncompetitors in relation to that market; and\n\n(b) the degree of specificity of the information; and\n\n(c) whether the information relates to past, current or future\nactivities; and\n\n(d) how readily available the information is to the public; and\n\n(e) whether the disclosure is part of a pattern of similar\ndisclosures by the corporation.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In determining, for the purpose of this section, if a corporation has\nmade a disclosure for the purpose of substantially lessening\ncompetition in a market, the matters to which the court may have\nregard include (but are not limited to):\n\n(a) whether the disclosure was a private disclosure to\ncompetitors in relation to that market; and\n\n(b) the degree of specificity of the information; and\n\n(c) whether the information relates to past, current or future\nactivities; and\n\n(d) how readily available the information is to the public; and\n\n(e) whether the disclosure is part of a pattern of similar\ndisclosures by the corporation.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
