      "cml:integrityHash": "67e7d47d256196b6f8f87c033730ab55f33f340f6676405604857d1681331af1",
      "skos:note": "Disclosures to non-competitors must be disregarded if made to avoid section 44ZZW application. Court may consider factors when determining if a corporation made a disclosure to substantially lessen competition in a market."
    },
