    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-8-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8(2) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-8-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Sections 44ZZW and 44ZZX do not apply to the disclosure of\ninformation by a corporation if the disclosure is to one or more\nbodies corporate that are related to the corporation, and is not to\nany other person.\nNote:\nThe effect of section 44ZZU must be taken into account in working\nout whether the disclosure is to one or more bodies corporate that are\nrelated to the corporation, and is not to any other person.\nDisclosure for collective bargaining",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Sections 44ZZW and 44ZZX do not apply to the disclosure of\ninformation by a corporation if the disclosure is to one or more\nbodies corporate that are related to the corporation, and is not to\nany other person.\nNote:\nThe effect of section 44ZZU must be taken into account in working\nout whether the disclosure is to one or more bodies corporate that are\nrelated to the corporation, and is not to any other person.\nDisclosure for collective bargaining",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-8"
      },
