          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-8-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-8-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ba53f5eed9f73dd212d3469cffc4e62ffa6b3d53cbdc29ab2fa570d50aeba9e7",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information by a corporation is permitted if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-8-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(4) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Sections 44ZZW and 44ZZX do not apply to the disclosure of\ninformation by a corporation if:\n\n(a) an authorisation under section 88 (other than subsection\n88(6A)) applies to or in relation to the corporation; and\n\n(b) the authorisation is in force; and\n\n(c) the disclosure of the information is made in the course of\nengaging in conduct that is covered by the authorisation.\nNote:\nA disclosure that would otherwise contravene section 44ZZW or\n44ZZX can also be directly authorised under subsection 88(6A).\nDisclosure covered by notification under section 93"
    },
