      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Sections 44ZZW and 44ZZX do not apply to the disclosure of\ninformation by a corporation if:\n\n(a) the corporation has given the Commission a notice under\nsubsection 93(1) describing conduct; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is conduct described in the notice; and\n\n(c) the notice is in force under section 93.\nCompliance with continuous disclosure requirements of the\nCorporations Act 2001",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Sections 44ZZW and 44ZZX do not apply to the disclosure of\ninformation by a corporation if:\n\n(a) the corporation has given the Commission a notice under\nsubsection 93(1) describing conduct; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is conduct described in the notice; and\n\n(c) the notice is in force under section 93.\nCompliance with continuous disclosure requirements of the\nCorporations Act 2001",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-8"
      },
