      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The disclosure of information by the corporation to the person.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The validation is that the disclosure of information is valid."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(3) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation if:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) the corporation is a participant in a joint venture for the\nproduction and/or supply of goods or services; or\n\n(ii) the corporation proposes to enter into a joint venture\nwith one or more other persons (the proposed\nparticipants); and\n\n(b) the disclosure is to one or more participants or proposed\nparticipants in the joint venture, and is not to any other\nperson; and\n\n(c) the disclosure is made for the purposes of the joint venture or\nin the course of negotiations for the joint venture.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            11\nNote:\nThe effect of section 44ZZU must be taken into account in working\nout whether the disclosure is to one or more participants in the joint\nventure, and is not to any other person.\nDisclosure relating to provision of loans etc. to same person",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation if:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) the corporation is a participant in a joint venture for the\nproduction and/or supply of goods or services; or\n\n(ii) the corporation proposes to enter into a joint venture\nwith one or more other persons (the proposed\nparticipants); and\n\n(b) the disclosure is to one or more participants or proposed\nparticipants in the joint venture, and is not to any other\nperson; and\n\n(c) the disclosure is made for the purposes of the joint venture or\nin the course of negotiations for the joint venture.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            11\nNote:\nThe effect of section 44ZZU must be taken into account in working\nout whether the disclosure is to one or more participants in the joint\nventure, and is not to any other person.\nDisclosure relating to provision of loans etc. to same person",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ffc0c0f93e67329f8ff244efb1ba74453572c656ff2baebf77fce37bbfc538ad",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information by corporation in joint venture is permitted under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(3) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation if:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) the corporation is a participant in a joint venture for the\nproduction and/or supply of goods or services; or\n\n(ii) the corporation proposes to enter into a joint venture\nwith one or more other persons (the proposed\nparticipants); and\n\n(b) the disclosure is to one or more participants or proposed\nparticipants in the joint venture, and is not to any other\nperson; and\n\n(c) the disclosure is made for the purposes of the joint venture or\nin the course of negotiations for the joint venture.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011            11\nNote:\nThe effect of section 44ZZU must be taken into account in working\nout whether the disclosure is to one or more participants in the joint\nventure, and is not to any other person.\nDisclosure relating to provision of loans etc. to same person"
    },
