      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3A) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information between 2 or more corporations (the relevant corporations) if:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The disclosure is permitted."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(3B) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10-ss-3b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation to another person if:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) the corporation is a credit provider, and the other person\nprovides a credit service, within the meaning of the\nNational Consumer Credit Protection Act 2009; or\n\n(ii) the corporation provides a credit service, and the other\nperson is a credit provider, within the meaning of that\nAct; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is made in the course of the relationship\nbetween the corporation and the other person in their\ncapacities as credit provider and provider of a credit service.\nDisclosure relating to acquisition of shares or assets",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation to another person if:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) the corporation is a credit provider, and the other person\nprovides a credit service, within the meaning of the\nNational Consumer Credit Protection Act 2009; or\n\n(ii) the corporation provides a credit service, and the other\nperson is a credit provider, within the meaning of that\nAct; and\n\n(b) the disclosure is made in the course of the relationship\nbetween the corporation and the other person in their\ncapacities as credit provider and provider of a credit service.\nDisclosure relating to acquisition of shares or assets",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3b-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-10-ss-3b-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3aec064f328d00ac613f9284a2fb1d1fbba23b154db00474c402aef9223d4849",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information by a corporation to another person is permitted under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-10-ss-3b",
