      "values:originalText": "(4) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation in so far as the information is disclosed in connection\nwith a contract, arrangement or understanding that provides, or a\nproposed contract, arrangement or understanding that would\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na corporation in so far as the information is disclosed in connection\nwith a contract, arrangement or understanding that provides, or a\nproposed contract, arrangement or understanding that would\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
