    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-5d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6(5D) After subsection 90(5B)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-5d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(5D) The Commission must not make a determination granting an\nauthorisation under subsection 88(6A) in respect of a proposed\ndisclosure of information to which section 44ZZX would or might\napply, unless the Commission is satisfied in all the circumstances:\n\n(a) that the proposed disclosure would result, or be likely to\nresult, in a benefit to the public; and\n\n(b) that the benefit would outweigh the detriment to the public\nconstituted by any lessening of competition that would result,\nor be likely to result, if the corporation so disclosed the\ninformation.",
      "skos:definition": "(5D) The Commission must not make a determination granting an\nauthorisation under subsection 88(6A) in respect of a proposed\ndisclosure of information to which section 44ZZX would or might\napply, unless the Commission is satisfied in all the circumstances:\n\n(a) that the proposed disclosure would result, or be likely to\nresult, in a benefit to the public; and\n\n(b) that the benefit would outweigh the detriment to the public\nconstituted by any lessening of competition that would result,\nor be likely to result, if the corporation so disclosed the\ninformation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-6-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-6-2-ss-5d-norm"
