      },
      "cml:operator": "Permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Intermediary may disclose information to others",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) the first person makes the disclosure to the intermediary for the purpose of the intermediary disclosing (or arranging for the disclosure of) the information to one or more other persons;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The intermediary is permitted to disclose the information to others."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-3-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "State obligation to regulate disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Competition and Consumer Amendment Act C2011A00185",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The state is obligated to regulate the disclosure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16(4) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\nperson (the first person) to another person (the recipient) is to be\ndisregarded if the disclosure to the recipient is due to:\n\n(a) an accident; or\n\n(b) the default of a person other than the first person; or\n\n(c) some other cause beyond the control of the first person.\nNote:\nThis subsection does not apply to a disclosure of information covered\nby subsection (3).\nSection 84 not limited",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purpose of this Division, the disclosure of information by a\nperson (the first person) to another person (the recipient) is to be\ndisregarded if the disclosure to the recipient is due to:\n\n(a) an accident; or\n\n(b) the default of a person other than the first person; or\n\n(c) some other cause beyond the control of the first person.\nNote:\nThis subsection does not apply to a disclosure of information covered\nby subsection (3).\nSection 84 not limited",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "712488f66d23dce4ef842ddd08d64cbd50ff07c83756a0181be64b999726e506",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information is disregarded if due to accident, default, or other cause beyond control."
    },
    {
