      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purpose of determining whether a person (the first person)\nhas made a private disclosure to competitors in relation to a\nparticular market, the fact that the disclosure is also made to\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purpose of determining whether a person (the first person)\nhas made a private disclosure to competitors in relation to a\nparticular market, the fact that the disclosure is also made to\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5e8575346a522238420b19817c8c89121722bfa479a58b9724f0eb6de44c96dd",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information by a person to another person is disregarded if made in the other person's capacity as an agent. Duty to determine private disclosure to competitors in relation to a particular market."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-16-2-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
