    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(3A) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-22-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information\nbetween 2 or more persons (the relevant persons) if:\n\n(a) the information relates to services, being loans or credit,\nsupplied, or likely to be supplied, by one or more of the\nrelevant persons; and\n\n(b) 2 or more of the relevant persons are, in relation to the same\nperson (the borrower), doing either or both of the following:\n\n(i) providing such services to the borrower;\n\n(ii) considering whether to provide such services to the\nborrower;\n\n(c) the disclosure is for the purpose of, or related to, providing\nservices, or considering whether to provide services, to the\nborrower as mentioned in paragraph (b).\nDisclosure between credit provider and provider of credit service",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information\nbetween 2 or more persons (the relevant persons) if:\n\n(a) the information relates to services, being loans or credit,\nsupplied, or likely to be supplied, by one or more of the\nrelevant persons; and\n\n(b) 2 or more of the relevant persons are, in relation to the same\nperson (the borrower), doing either or both of the following:\n\n(i) providing such services to the borrower;\n\n(ii) considering whether to provide such services to the\nborrower;\n\n(c) the disclosure is for the purpose of, or related to, providing\nservices, or considering whether to provide services, to the\nborrower as mentioned in paragraph (b).\nDisclosure between credit provider and provider of credit service",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ee56c1b1de5023156364b4a8ef1029207f974966e8a876a0675b3b873a6508b7",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information between relevant persons is permitted under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-22-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22(3A) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information\nbetween 2 or more persons (the relevant persons) if:\n\n(a) the information relates to services, being loans or credit,\nsupplied, or likely to be supplied, by one or more of the\nrelevant persons; and\n\n(b) 2 or more of the relevant persons are, in relation to the same\nperson (the borrower), doing either or both of the following:\n\n(i) providing such services to the borrower;\n\n(ii) considering whether to provide such services to the\nborrower;\n\n(c) the disclosure is for the purpose of, or related to, providing\nservices, or considering whether to provide services, to the\nborrower as mentioned in paragraph (b).\nDisclosure between credit provider and provider of credit service"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-3a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
