    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22(4) Competition and Consumer Amendment Act (No. 1) 2011       No. 185, 2011",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-22-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-act.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na person (the first person) in so far as the information is disclosed\nin connection with a contract, arrangement or understanding that\nprovides, or a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding\nthat would provide, for the acquisition of any shares in the capital\nof a body corporate, or any assets of a person, by or from the first\nperson.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of acquisition of shares, and acquisition of assets, see\nsubsection 4(4).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Section 44ZZW does not apply to the disclosure of information by\na person (the first person) in so far as the information is disclosed\nin connection with a contract, arrangement or understanding that\nprovides, or a proposed contract, arrangement or understanding\nthat would provide, for the acquisition of any shares in the capital\nof a body corporate, or any assets of a person, by or from the first\nperson.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of acquisition of shares, and acquisition of assets, see\nsubsection 4(4).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2011A00185\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-22-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9bc13d58f9c5c3a88fbc1fe959c85aebb7cbeeebd16fc409f6fd6bfcdb9335d5",
      "skos:note": "Prohibits disclosure of information in connection with a contract or arrangement for the acquisition of shares or assets."
    },
