      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If:\n\n(a) proceedings are brought against a person in respect of section 44ZZW or 44ZZX; and\n\n(b) the person seeks to rely on subsection 44ZZU(2) or (4), or on a subsection of section 44ZZY or 44ZZZ;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must provide evidence."
    }
